# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide shows how to use PEC combined with SLC to mitigate gate noise with reduced shot overhead compared to vanilla PEC.\n"
msgstr "Panduan ini menunjukkan cara menggunakan PEC digabungkan dengan SLC untuk memitigasi hingar gate dengan overhed shot yang lebih rendah berbanding PEC asas.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The workflow follows:\n"
"1. Specify a circuit and observable.\n"
"2. Compute noisy, unmitigated expectation values.\n"
"3. Compute forward and backward bounds on the bias.\n"
"4. Learn the entangling layers' noise by using qiskit-noise-learning.\n"
"5. Use the learned noise to merge the computed bounds into a local scales matrix.\n"
"6. Choose the desired bias bound based on the shot overhead-bias trade-off.\n"
"7. Prepare a PEC + SLC program, execute the program, and post-process.\n"
"8. Compare the mitigated expectation values and shot overhead.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aliran kerjanya adalah seperti berikut:\n"
"1. Nyatakan litar dan observable.\n"
"2. Kira nilai jangkaan berhingar tanpa mitigasi.\n"
"3. Kira had hadapan dan belakang bagi bias.\n"
"4. Pelajari hingar lapisan berbelit dengan menggunakan qiskit-noise-learning.\n"
"5. Gunakan hingar yang dipelajari untuk menggabungkan had yang dikira ke dalam matriks skala setempat.\n"
"6. Pilih had bias yang dikehendaki berdasarkan pertukaran antara overhed shot dengan bias.\n"
"7. Sediakan atur cara PEC + SLC, laksanakan atur cara itu, dan lakukan pasca-pemprosesan.\n"
"8. Bandingkan nilai jangkaan yang dimitigasi dan overhed shot.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specify a circuit and observable {#specify-a-circuit-and-observable}"
msgstr "Nyatakan litar dan observable {#specify-a-circuit-and-observable}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare a mirror circuit of a Trotterized time evolution of a 1D Ising chain Hamiltonian on eight qubits. Mirror the circuit to cancel its unitary and form an identity circuit, so each observable's ideal expectation value is known to be 1 without the need to compute it. In addition, mirroring doubles the circuit depth, which in turn doubles the noise's effect.\n"
msgstr "Sediakan litar cermin bagi evolusi masa Trotter untuk Hamiltonian rantai Ising 1D pada lapan qubit. Cerminkan litar untuk membatalkan unitarinya dan membentuk litar identiti, supaya nilai jangkaan unggul setiap observable diketahui sebagai 1 tanpa perlu mengiranya. Selain itu, pencerminan menggandakan kedalaman litar, yang seterusnya menggandakan kesan hingar.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the angle $\\theta= \\frac{\\pi}{4}$ to make the dynamics non-Clifford.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan sudut $\\theta= \\frac{\\pi}{4}$ untuk menjadikan dinamik bukan Clifford.\n"

