# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose desired bias bound based on shot overhead-bias trade-off {#choose-desired-bias-bound-based-on-shot-overhead-bias-trade-off}"
msgstr "Pilih had bias yang dikehendaki berdasarkan pertukaran antara overhed shot dengan bias {#choose-desired-bias-bound-based-on-shot-overhead-bias-trade-off}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this guide we choose a bias tolerance of 5%. Note that this bias calculation is based on the learned noise model, which might not be perfectly aligned with the real noise of the device.\n"
msgstr "Dalam panduan ini kami memilih toleransi bias sebanyak 5%. Perhatikan bahawa pengiraan bias ini berdasarkan model hingar yang dipelajari, yang mungkin tidak selari sepenuhnya dengan hingar sebenar peranti.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare a PEC + SLC program, execute the program, and post-process {#prepare-a-pec-slc-program-execute-the-program-and-post-process}"
msgstr "Sediakan atur cara PEC + SLC, laksanakan atur cara itu, dan lakukan pasca-pemprosesan {#prepare-a-pec-slc-program-execute-the-program-and-post-process}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With the local scales chosen, we can build the full PEC+SLC execution program. The `PEC.prepare` call constructs a `QuantumProgram` that encodes the anti-noise injection strategy into the circuit's box annotations. Passing `noise_gain=\"slc_local_scales\"` instructs the executor to use the per-error weights set by `set_slc_local_scales`, rather than applying the same full inverse-noise gain to every error as vanilla PEC would.\n"
msgstr "Dengan skala setempat yang telah dipilih, kita boleh membina atur cara pelaksanaan PEC+SLC yang lengkap. Panggilan `PEC.prepare` membina `QuantumProgram` yang mengekod strategi suntikan anti-hingar ke dalam anotasi kotak litar. Menghantar `noise_gain=\"slc_local_scales\"` mengarahkan executor menggunakan pemberat bagi setiap ralat yang ditetapkan oleh `set_slc_local_scales`, dan bukannya menerapkan gandaan hingar songsang penuh yang sama kepada setiap ralat seperti yang dilakukan PEC asas.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To produce a fair comparison, a second `PEC` task is prepared with `noise_gain=0`, which corresponds to full PEC cancellation with no SLC bias allowance. Both programs are added to the same `QuantumProgram` so they share a single execution job — their circuits are interleaved and executed together, meaning any hardware drift affects both equally.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menghasilkan perbandingan yang adil, tugas `PEC` kedua disediakan dengan `noise_gain=0`, yang sepadan dengan pembatalan PEC penuh tanpa kelonggaran bias SLC. Kedua-dua atur cara ditambahkan ke dalam `QuantumProgram` yang sama supaya berkongsi satu job pelaksanaan — litar mereka diselang-seli dan dilaksanakan bersama, bermakna sebarang hanyutan perkakasan menjejaskan kedua-duanya secara sama rata.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After the job completes, `postprocess` converts the raw measurement bitstrings into expectation values, applying the appropriate PEC rescaling factor γ for each task.\n"
msgstr "Selepas job selesai, `postprocess` menukarkan rentetan bit pengukuran mentah kepada nilai jangkaan, dengan menerapkan faktor penskalaan semula PEC γ yang sesuai bagi setiap tugas.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare the mitigated expectation values and shot overhead {#compare-the-mitigated-expectation-values-and-shot-overhead}"
msgstr "Bandingkan nilai jangkaan yang dimitigasi dan overhed shot {#compare-the-mitigated-expectation-values-and-shot-overhead}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The ideal expectation value of the mirrored circuit is 1 by construction, so the bias of any estimate is simply `|1 - result|`. This final cell prints the bias and total shot count for three scenarios side-by-side:\n"
msgstr "Nilai jangkaan unggul bagi litar cermin ialah 1 mengikut binaan, jadi bias mana-mana anggaran ialah `|1 - result|` sahaja. Sel akhir ini mencetak bias dan jumlah bilangan shot bagi tiga senario secara bersebelahan:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Unmitigated**: the raw noisy expectation value with no error cancellation applied.\n"
msgstr "**Tanpa mitigasi**: nilai jangkaan berhingar mentah tanpa sebarang pembatalan ralat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Full PEC**: zero-bias error cancellation using the complete inverse noise model on every layer, at the full γ² sampling overhead.\n"
msgstr "**PEC penuh**: pembatalan ralat tanpa bias menggunakan model hingar songsang lengkap pada setiap lapisan, pada overhed persampelan γ² penuh.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**PEC+SLC**: error cancellation guided by the shaded-lightcone local scales, tolerating the chosen `bias_tolerance` in exchange for a substantially lower shot count.\n"
msgstr "**PEC+SLC**: pembatalan ralat yang dipandu oleh skala setempat shaded-lightcone, dengan bertoleransi terhadap `bias_tolerance` yang dipilih sebagai pertukaran untuk bilangan shot yang jauh lebih rendah.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Comparing the three rows shows the concrete benefit of SLC: the mitigated bias of PEC+SLC stays well below the unmitigated bias while the total number of shots is significantly smaller than what full PEC required.\n"
msgstr "Membandingkan ketiga-tiga baris menunjukkan manfaat konkrit SLC: bias terimitigasi PEC+SLC kekal jauh di bawah bias tanpa mitigasi manakala jumlah bilangan shot jauh lebih kecil daripada yang diperlukan oleh PEC penuh.\n"
